  "prefLabel": "Jus 813.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 813.02 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply whenever any person has a right under applicable law to request a rehearing of a decision prior to filing an appeal of the decision with the court having appellate jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #7129, eff 5-3-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus800.html"
